ate the DNA damage response</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><year>2003</year><volume>160</volume><fpage>1017</fpage><lpage>1027</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Cell Biol||160|1017||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12668657</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kawaguchi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Kovacs</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>McLaurin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vance</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Yao</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The deacetylase HDAC6 regulates aggresome formation and cell viability in response to misfolded protein stress</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>2003</year><volume>115</volume><fpage>727</fpage><lpage>738</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cell||115|727||bib23|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14675537</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kawai</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Avraham</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Jiang</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Avraham</surname><given-names>HK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Overexpression of histone deacetylase HDAC1 modulates breast cancer progression by negative regulation of estrogen receptor <italic>&#x003b1;</italic></article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>2003</year><volume>107</volume><fpage>353</fpage><lpage>358</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Cancer||107|353||bib24|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14506733</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="j